<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49799" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰβυκτήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, in Cretan, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who begins a war-song</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βηκ-</span> cod.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰβύκχα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμνότης, ἢ σωρὸς κρεῶν</span>, Id.
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ύηχ-</span> cod.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶβυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υκος</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἶβις</span>, Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴβυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υος</span>, ὁ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφημία, στιγμή</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰβύω</span></b> , <i>shout:
			strike</i>, Id.; cf. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰβῶν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐφημῶν, στάζων</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγα</span></b> , in Cretan,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίγα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγγι</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμίᾳ τινὶ ἑλκομένη</span>, Id. (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴυγγι</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγγια:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷς</span> (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγδην</span></b>  and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγνην:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρσην</span>, Id.</div>
